  "description": "The libsodium package for the Lumoin family. Crypto binding: Ed25519 seed-keypair generation, detached signing and verification, Ed25519-to-X25519 key conversion, X25519 scalar multiplication, XChaCha20-Poly1305 authenticated encryption, and the ML-KEM-768 (FIPS 203) and X-Wing hybrid post-quantum KEMs as thin Span-based LibraryImport wrappers, with secret-key scratch memory composed by the caller as a MemoryPool<byte>. Memory backing: SodiumBacking implements the NativeBackingAllocator seam so BaseMemoryPool serves AllocationKind.Native rents as per-rent isolated sodium_malloc guarded allocations (not available on browser-wasm). Depends only on Lumoin.Base. The libsodium native library ships inside the package, built by the family from pinned upstream source: shared libraries for win-x64/arm64, linux-x64/arm64, osx-x64/arm64 and android-arm64/x64, a static xcframework linked into iOS and Mac Catalyst app builds through the package's buildTransitive targets, and static linking at publish on browser-wasm.",
